---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <div class="footer-state">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Current product state</p>
        <h2>Live software. Review-first boundaries. No invented proof.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        RolePatch is maintained and publicly usable. Guest work stays in the current browser;
        Google sign-in adds account persistence. Token packs are implemented, while the maker's
        own new-application validation is paused because he is not currently job hunting.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a href="/" class="brand-link">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">RP</span>
          <span>RolePatch</span>
        </a>
        <p>
          Tailor one resume to one job description, keep every claim grounded in supplied
          evidence, and review the patch before it leaves your hands.
        </p>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="RolePatch product links">
        <p class="footer-heading">Product</p>
        <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/jobs">Browse jobs</a>
        <a href="/evidence">Evidence bank</a>
        <a href="/proof">Proof packets</a>
        <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>
      </nav>
      <nav aria-label="RolePatch resources">
        <p class="footer-heading">Understand</p>
        <a href="/tools">Free tools</a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
        <a href="/changelog">Changelog</a>
        <a href="/llms.txt">LLM index</a>
        <a href="/docs">Developer docs</a>
        <a href="/openapi.json">OpenAPI schema</a>
        <a href="/index.md">Product brief</a>
      </nav>
      <nav aria-label="RolePatch legal and owner links">
        <p class="footer-heading">Trust</p>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/Significant-Hobbies/rolepatch">Source</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/Significant-Hobbies/rolepatch/issues">Roadmap</a>
        <a href="https://sarthakagrawal.dev">Maker</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-tools">
      <p>Explore the Fleet project strip or ask AI about RolePatch below.</p>
      <p>© {year} Sarthak Agrawal · No unattended bulk apply · No CAPTCHA bypass</p>
    </div>

    <portfolio-project-strip
      current-project="rolepatch"
      label="Other Fleet projects"
    ></portfolio-project-strip>
    <script is:inline src="/project-strip.js" data-project="rolepatch" defer></script>
    <script
      is:inline
      src="https://sassmaker.com/ai-chat-footer.js"
      data-name="RolePatch"
      data-compose="false"
      defer
    ></script>
  </div>
</footer>
